title: The Banking Clan Crisis
subtitle: The Chancellery moves to take control of the galaxy's banks.
tags: event
view-if: war and (date >= 156 or (debt >= 30 and date >= 146)) and (pal_chancellor or puppet_chancellor) and not banking_seizure_seen and not finale
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_trade.svg
on-arrival: {! Q.banking_seizure_seen = 1; if (Q.guild_leader_id === 'clovis') SW.setLeader(Q, 'guild', 'san_hill'); !}

= The Banking Clan Crisis

After a scandal involving the Muun banker Rush Clovis, the InterGalactic Banking Clan is in chaos. The Chancellor proposes to place it under the "temporary supervision" of the Office of the Chancellor. The Banking Clan finances both sides of the war.

[? if banking_independent : The Banking Independence Act forbids exactly this. The Chancellor's proposal is dead on arrival. ?]

[? if pl_no_powers : **We pledged the [+ pledge_no_powers_name +] no new emergency powers. Supporting them will break that pledge.** ?]

- @oppose: Oppose the takeover.
- @support: Support it: someone must restore order.
- @blocked: The law forbids it.

@blocked
view-if: banking_independent
on-arrival: evidence += 0.5; senate_resolve += 0.5

The proposal is withdrawn. Rush Clovis, before vanishing, sends the Caucus a datacard of the Clan's loans to both sides. Several are guaranteed by the Chancellor's own office.

@oppose
view-if: not banking_independent
on-arrival: {!
var st = {pal: 1, sec: 0.8, mod: 0.45, guild: 0.25, ind: 0.45, rim: 0.4, rfc: 0.3};
Q.bs_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 0, 'powers');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Supervision of the Banking Clan', Q.bs_vote);
if (Q.bs_vote >= 50) { Q.emergency_powers += 1; Q.banks_seized = 1; Q.war_balance += 0.5; }
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if banks_seized : The Banking Clan now answers to the Chancellor. Whoever controls the money controls the war, on both sides. ?][? if not banks_seized : The proposal fails. ?]

@support
view-if: not banking_independent
on-arrival: {!
var st = {pal: 1, sec: 0.8, mod: 0.45, guild: 0.25, ind: 0.45, rim: 0.4, rfc: 0.3};
Q.bs_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, 'powers');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Supervision of the Banking Clan', Q.bs_vote);
if (Q.bs_vote >= 50) { Q.emergency_powers += 1; Q.banks_seized = 1; Q.war_balance += 0.5; }
!}

[+ vote_html +]
